title: "self-mass-unobservability: staged calculations around self-mass unobservability and the tied-vs-decoupled EFT question"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Juneyoung, Kim"
repository-code: "https://github.com/lpaiu-cs/self-mass-unobservability"
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-07-08
version: "0.1.0"
abstract: >-
  Research workspace for staged calculations around self-mass unobservability
  and the tied-vs-decoupled EFT question: analytic center-of-mass and
  internal-structure consistency checks, a mock LLR injection-recovery study,
  real-data LLR ingest and estimator hand-off audits, a PSR J0337+1715
  published-bound translation, a binary-pulsar clock-sector audit, and a
  provisional joint consistency scaffold.
keywords:
  - strong equivalence principle
  - gravitational self-energy
  - effective field theory
  - lunar laser ranging
  - pulsar timing
